{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>新晉影后鍾雪瑩（鍾說）今日（13日）凌晨突然於社交平台Instagram限時動態發帖，公開控訴一名文化界寫手兼主編，指其評論文章用字「嘩眾取寵」，更與電影作品《善男信女》本身毫無關係，對其撰文角度與用字表達極度反感！隨後，撰文控訴在專訪時遭遇性騷擾的袁澧林亦迅速轉發帖文聲援。</p><figure><img alt=\"鍾雪瑩於2024年主演黃修平導演的《看我今天怎麼說》，飾演聾啞女孩「方素恩」一角，成功奪得金馬影后。（IG/@csy）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261013/1186677090938785792183702.jpeg/3FkGRfZZgOqxKWgXApXhIjfj5sb0nIK2ZEqkmmRKpJo\"/><figcaption>鍾雪瑩於2024年主演黃修平導演的《看我今天怎麼說》，飾演聾啞女孩「方素恩」一角，成功奪得金馬影后。（IG/@csy）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"鍾雪多才多藝。（IG/@csy）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261013/1186678970360270848840195.jpeg/JlEBHm5XEX4Vt1xftJMe9HgLFvFpDKRTWw60BFsOtAQ\"/><figcaption>鍾雪多才多藝。（IG/@csy）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"鍾雪多才多藝。（IG/@csy）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261013/1186678972696629248310458.jpeg/AB18t4qMXnFxieKptYfKpderEY2ggMnLIa1QXiGtUF4\"/><figcaption>鍾雪多才多藝。（IG/@csy）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"鍾雪多才多藝。（IG/@csy）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261013/1186678977277071360721430.jpeg/Wa05qZgTl2k_eqdKsGbxFxMFYiy_KcGsINvFnSDbxZ0\"/><figcaption>鍾雪多才多藝。（IG/@csy）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"鍾雪多才多藝。（IG/@csy）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261013/1186678974999433216389741.jpeg/shO7WzJzDzz4pK0pwxXND40MoLI13v_YBeL2EQXi9hE\"/><figcaption>鍾雪多才多藝。（IG/@csy）</figcaption></figure><p>控訴文化界主編嘩眾取寵　鍾雪瑩：睇唔到同套戲有咩關係</p><p>鍾雪瑩於限時動態中上載了一張帖子截圖，圖中顯示該篇來自文化界寫手兼主編的文章，竟寫有「瞞住『阿爹』撻著阿倫，鍾說老師從影生涯激罕色慾演出，少少震撼」等惹火字眼。</p><p>對此，鍾雪瑩展現直率性格，公開了自己昨日私訊回覆該作者的內容，正面反駁道：「我對你呢段文字好反感，除咗話你嘩眾取寵之外，完全睇唔到同套戲有咩關係。無論如何，多謝你來欣賞我哋嘅電影。」</p><figure><img alt=\"鍾雪瑩引述一篇文化界記者或主編介紹《善男信女》的文章，並批評言論。（IG/@csy）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261013/1186613811457560576236194.jpeg/3Mo8RkD0NFrEnYa62upODkEtoav4zH5kcRYgj3EWII8\"/><figcaption>鍾雪瑩引述一篇文化界記者或主編介紹《善男信女》的文章，並批評言論。（IG/@csy）</figcaption></figure><p>嚴正質疑撰文角度　鍾說痛心：何不只說好？</p><p>對於該名主編的撰文角度與手法，鍾雪瑩在帖子中提出嚴正質疑。她認為原意用來褒獎與推廣好作品的文章，絕不應流於誇張與偏頗的呈現方式。她字字珠璣地寫道：「這種角度、這些用字，加點不實，這樣嗎？你認為作品好，何不只說好，而仍然是要這樣嗎？」希望外界將焦點重新放回電影與演員的專業付出上，而非靠博眼球的偏頗字句吸睛。</p><p>袁澧林全文如下：</p><figure><img alt=\"川島小鳥拍攝文青女神袁澧林Angela，別具氣質。（利園提供）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/289376/org/6f2d6abccafbaeb0e8309374029b6e47.jpg/GpgA7CPLUFzS-dmXADmj_hulXJylTkDj4a5fnuGuX54\"/><figcaption>川島小鳥拍攝文青女神袁澧林Angela，別具氣質。（利園提供）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（IG/@angela.yuen）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261013/1186618618931187712572491.jpeg/aK8F3Wy_wT_S3BTxARBoIPsUQEv8HusF5L6QaOS-kGg\"/><figcaption>（IG/@angela.yuen）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（IG/@angela.yuen）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261013/1186618623989780480309758.jpeg/2qLFTGlximEForcKXvtsGqi4nZ2nPZXU1-N5stfjebI\"/><figcaption>（IG/@angela.yuen）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（IG/@angela.yuen）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261013/1186618615940517888783216.jpeg/pd0Lg_-7nR3_kuEECO3lPPLZbTyUiol3rWZut61mbrc\"/><figcaption>（IG/@angela.yuen）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（IG/@angela.yuen）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261013/1186618621393375232601983.jpeg/nQ91tZgfFvofHQi6xXolW8QyUvMGIrHTGyIPyxsiD8s\"/><figcaption>（IG/@angela.yuen）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（IG/@angela.yuen）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261013/1186618618687918080638947.jpeg/V_R3ZuRLd39ZECmQaiHjCEEVGQqTc-rGXdbVvV3W1b0\"/><figcaption>（IG/@angela.yuen）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（IG/@angela.yuen）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261013/1186618616338976768721609.jpeg/CfoIe95VsWX3J1SGJKuu0u0A9R3Fsn2NobZEmKG2RJg\"/><figcaption>（IG/@angela.yuen）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（IG/@angela.yuen）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261013/1186618621108162560435290.jpeg/KTFYxbgTrFMs05fbHgw1GnKk8kGsQaWsOORh5TjkYeU\"/><figcaption>（IG/@angela.yuen）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（IG/@angela.yuen）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261013/1186618626313555968268503.jpeg/D3IJt-I-MnTilCP4fYpPxJ2mUj7G9oaIaBO8a2gTvGs\"/><figcaption>（IG/@angela.yuen）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-13T06:40:24.271772+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":869,"images":15,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"},"published_at":"2026-10-13T06:15:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-13T07:18:52.796456+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:37:54.245724+00:00","content_hash":"48e2dda2f6457d378dc7e605d42807fc591abf2c62e75fe0f2f9b47a05d409b0","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null}